<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN LEADING THIRD ROUND SCORES. [CORRECTED 12:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>GOLF-QUEENSLAND OPEN LEADING THIRD ROUND SCORES. [CORRECTED 12:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
